SOAPBOX: K3CCR is the club station at the Collington continuing-care
SOAPBOX: retirement community at FM 18OW in MD, just east of DC. N3UM and
SOAPBOX: W5MPB did Multi-Op 2 Tx HP in the 2025 CQ WW RTTY test. Condx and
SOAPBOX: activity were excellent we got 1378 Qs & a 2.06 M score claim, vs
SOAPBOX: 1 M in ’23 & ’24 doing SOHP & Multi-1. At start 0000-0234Z N3UM
SOAPBOX: got 83 20-M Qs, 58 in a run at 77/hr, then 13 40-M Qs 0241-0302Z.
SOAPBOX: W5MPB 0000-0212Z got 58 40-M Qs, then 0216-0303Z 19 80-M Qs. We
SOAPBOX: got many 3-pt Qs thru 0254Z then bad storm QRN, w/jumps to S8!
SOAPBOX: After just 6 1-pt Qs in 9 min, we quit at 0303Z to return early.
SOAPBOX: Back on 15 M 1105-1339Z W5MPB got 59 Qs. Then on 10 M at 1349Z he
SOAPBOX: got 86 Qs by 1621Z and quit to eat. Back at 1109Z N3UM got 82 20-M
SOAPBOX: Qs by 1511Z and quit to eat. Back 1727Z, W5MPB got 77 more 10-M Qs
SOAPBOX: by 1928. He got 93 15-M Qs 1932-2206Z & ate supper. He got 19 15-M
SOAPBOX: Qs & 12 10-M Qs 2304-0011Z. On 80 M 0023 to 0429Z QRT he got 109
SOAPBOX: Qs. N3UM 1740-2122Z got 99 20-M Qs, 55 in a run, & ate supper.
SOAPBOX: Back 2210-2225Z N3UM got 9 20-M Qs, then 135 40-M Qs 2238Z to QRT
SOAPBOX: at 0427Z QRT, 38 running. Back on 1106-1452Z W5MPB got 91 15-M Qs
SOAPBOX: & ate lunch. Back on 1248-1541Z N3UM got 68 20-M Qs and 36 15-M Qs
SOAPBOX: 1600-1632Z. He then ate & did a non-ham thing. Back at 1856Z, he
SOAPBOX: got 103 20-M Qs by 2211Z & quit too few sigs to need 2 ops. After
SOAPBOX: lunch 1602-1645Z W5MPB got 16 20-M Qs, then 30 10-M Qs 1649-1801Z.
SOAPBOX: He then had a bad computer crash ~30 min to reboot, then supper.
SOAPBOX: Back on 1903-2043Z he got 50 15-M Qs. Then 2100-2359Z he hopped 4
SOAPBOX: bands for 67 Qs 10 on 80 M, 19 on 40 M, 2 on 15 M, & 19 on 10 M.
